    "title": "Deputies: NC man found passed out in truck, arrested on drug charges - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lorenza Medley ,\n13 hours ago MCDOWELL COUNTY, N.C. (FOX Carolina) - A man was arrested on drug charges out of McDowell County after he was found passed out in a truck. The McDowell County Sheriff’s Office said 21-year-old Haven Michael Brown from Marion was arrested after deputies patrolling the Nebo area saw him passed out inside a truck and stopped to check on his welfare. Read full article\n4",
